{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/5594-beyond-two-souls-or-i-am-my-own-memento","id":5594,"title":"Beyond: Two Souls or I Am My Own Memento","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-07T17:18:45-08:00","id":5594,"title":"Beyond: Two Souls or I Am My Own Memento","content":"I saw a playthrough of Beyond: Two Souls on Youtube and I was thinking of how the game is kinda like Geist. Jodie makes a good Sin-Eater and the spoilerific revelation that Aiden, your guardian spirit was her stillborn brother made me think: What if your Bound has unknown relations with his/her Geist? Would there be a possibility of him/her becoming the Geist's Key Memento/ What kind of possibilities would a Jodie/Aiden relationship have with the Sin-Eater's second life?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T23:38:10-08:00","id":5758,"title":"","content":"Speaking about the general idea, not so much the case of Beyond: Two Souls.<br /> <br /> Can the Sin-Eater be their geist's Key Memento? Not likely, since Mementos are inanimate objects of powers.<br /> <br /> I assume you mean Anchors! If a Sin-Eater -was- somebody's primary anchor before becoming a geist, then going by the book the anchor was probably resolved or the ghost was probably exorcised to the Underworld - after all, the metamorphosis to geist rarely happens without a detour in the Underworld, and almost all geists have lost their anchors and have warped themselves in weird ways just to be able to escape the Underworld! So really, that's not much different.<br /> <br /> Thematically, can there be a connection between a Bound and her Geist from before a Geist's death? Absolutely, While there probably wouldn't be any difference mechanically because of it, the geist itself is probably more human than most geists are, though whoever it was before it died it was going to be quite a bit different when it died, not to mention after being twisted and reformed into a geist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T12:01:21-08:00","id":47524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kirby Jerusalem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/5594-beyond-two-souls-or-i-am-my-own-memento?p=5758#post5758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking about the general idea, not so much the case of Beyond: Two Souls.<br /> <br /> Can the Sin-Eater be their geist's Key Memento? Not likely, since Mementos are inanimate objects of powers.<br /> <br /> I assume you mean Anchors! If a Sin-Eater -was- somebody's primary anchor before becoming a geist, then going by the book the anchor was probably resolved or the ghost was probably exorcised to the Underworld - after all, the metamorphosis to geist rarely happens without a detour in the Underworld, and almost all geists have lost their anchors and have warped themselves in weird ways just to be able to escape the Underworld! So really, that's not much different.<br /> <br /> Thematically, can there be a connection between a Bound and her Geist from before a Geist's death? Absolutely, While there probably wouldn't be any difference mechanically because of it, the geist itself is probably more human than most geists are, though whoever it was before it died it was going to be quite a bit different when it died, not to mention after being twisted and reformed into a geist.</div> </div> </div> </div>Very well spoken! Now if the Geist is somehow connected to it's Bound partner when the creature was living it is likely they are a very &quot;young&quot; Geist, therefore while one anchor has be replaced by an archetype, the majority of the Ghost's personality is still there- granted it is now colored by the archetype that it is representing. So while even more of the person is gone now, they are not so twisted as to be unrecognizable yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T16:16:42-08:00","id":50208,"title":"","content":"It does fit the theme. In the game it is stated that She is some form of psychic and both of her parents were as well. So the connection between the Geist and the psychic works really well with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}